      "created_at": "2015-01-23T19:03:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm wondering what would be a good matchup if I only have a short amount of time to play. &nbsp;D<span>o peo</span><span>ple have recommendations for what Hero/Villian/Enviornment combinations make for interesting, shorter games? &nbsp;I'm not looking for unbalanced games where the heroes smack down a villain really quickly (or vice versa), but games that could go either way but tend not to take as long. &nbsp;I'm thinking it would have to involve some of the less complicated heroes vs. villains that don't get a ton of cards in play, as both of those tend to slow gameplay down. &nbsp;Suggestions?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
