      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-23T21:15:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For the shortest possible game, Iron Legacy, every time. High chance of losing, but you asked for a short game, not a victorious one ;).</p><p>Ambuscade can be reasonably quick due to his relatively low health (as long as he doesn't manage to stay cloaked for ages).</p><p>Plague Rat if you have Chrono Ranger on the team - those two tear each other to bits.</p>",
