      "created_at": "2015-01-23T22:52:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>plague rat and chrono ranger is one of my favorite tear each other up hit em hard matchups.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A fun, and surprisingly quick, game is Legacy, Ra, Wraith, and another damage dealer against Akash. With the pumped damage Legacy+Ra+Wraith can dish out, the limbs fall fast and the game goes quick.</p>",
