      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/a3d4f5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-23T23:00:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Variant (Mad Bomber) Baron Blade isn't a bad choice, either. Especially since letting the game drag on generally isn't in the players' favor. Paired with a reasonably straightforward environment (Insula Primalis, Megalopolis, even Ruins of Atlantis - just not places like Tomb of Anubis or Freedom Tower), it should be a reasonably quick game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
